g/wiki/File:E%27Dawn_going_to_a_Music_Bank_recording_on_July_22,_2018.png","author":"dispatchsns","license":"CC BY 3.0"},"bio":{"text":"Kim Hyo-jong, known professionally as Dawn (던; formerly E'Dawn), is a South Korean rapper and dancer. Dawn is best known as a rapper, singer and songwriter of the South Korean boy band Pentagon, releasing nine EPs in both Korean and Japanese before his departure from Cube Entertainment in 2018. Dawn also participated in the group Triple H alongside (then) bandmate Hui and labelmate Hyuna for the release of two EPs. Dawn made his solo debut on November 5, 2019, releasing the single \"Money\".","title":"Dawn (rapper)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dawn_%28rapper%29"}},"Q47088961":{"id":"Q47088961","name":"Jo Woo-chan","ko":"조우찬","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Woochan"],"birth":"2005-01-20","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","rapper","actor"],"debut":"2025","agencies":[{"name":"The Black Label","korean":true,"id":"Q24866458","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q134986635","name":"AllDay Project","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/jowoochan_santa/","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/6f2bcfd3-68c0-42f6-b368-67253a1d7430"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Jo Woo-chan, known mononymously as Woochan, is a South Korean singer and rapper. He was a contestant on Show Me the Money 6 in 2017. He released his first collaborative single, \"OGZ\", on January 5, 2018. He debuted as a member of the South Korean co-ed group AllDay Project under The Black Label in June 2025.","title":"Jo Woo-chan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jo_Woo-chan"}},"Q5249793":{"id":"Q5249793","name":"Kim Jung-ah","ko":"정아","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Kim Jung Ah","Kim Junga","Kim Jung-a","Kim Jung A","Kim Jeongah","Kim Jeong-ah","Kim Jeong Ah","Kim Jeonga"],"birth":"1983-08-02","death":"","birthplace":"Incheon","nationality":[